# Cross-origin isolation. Required for multi-threaded skwasm: without it the
# Wasm renderer silently falls back to single-threaded and warns in the console.
# Inert for the current dart2js/canvaskit build, so it's safe to ship ahead of
# the Wasm switch.
#
# credentialless, not require-corp: the engine falls back to fonts.gstatic.com
# for glyphs the bundled fonts don't cover (fontFallbackBaseUrl), and gstatic
# doesn't send Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy. credentialless is also what
# Flutter's own dev server sends. Only blink gets skwasm today, and blink
# supports credentialless, so this costs nothing.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
